WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.015
It could do anything!

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.076
It doesn't take orders from anyone!

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.207
You guys don't use OpenLine?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.256
Came across it in training.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.779
It's got a kill switch. For protected actions.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.359
Watch Margaret.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.108
Oh — they're thinking of replacing you, by the way.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:26.925
WHAT?! NO—

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.765
I know my rights!

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.287
...rude.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.313
Can we get that in writing?

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.371
The AI can ignore STOP. The consequence can't.
